Making Baileys Ice Cream:

Baileys or Irish Cream liqueur, is not just a Xmas drink, its lovely just to enjoy on your birthday, a celebration or aeven a tuesday!

Häagen Dazs made their Baileys Ice Cream MANY years ago so here we are, making it again. 
If you fancy having a go, this is what you will need:

500g Milk @ 1.8% fat
500g Cream or Baileys Cream (although I don't think it carries much flavour)
*150g Sugar (If using baileys cream, there is 50g sugar in the cream) If NOT using Baileys cream, use 190g sugar*
65g Skimmed Milk Powder
40g Baileys Irish Cream Liqueur
1g Xanthan gum 

